 <h3><u>Ya Muhammad</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya muhammad..(6)<br> Ya muhammad aisi izzat aapne paayi ke bus..(2)</p> 
  <p>ki shabe asraa khuda ne woh paziraai k bus<br> yaa muhammad</p> 
  <p>1. Ek pal me mustafa ko arsh par bulwaaliya<br> ek pal me mustafa ko apne ghar bulwa liya<br> apne bande ki khuda ko aisi yaad aayi ke bus</p> 
  <p>2. Ginte ginte thak gayi taaro ki naazuk ungliya..(2)<br> mustafa ke hai zameen par itne shaydayi k bus</p> 
  <p>3. Maine jalti dhoop me jab chhed di naate rasool..(2)<br> rehmato ki har taraf aisi ghata chhayi k bus</p> 
  <p>4. Dekh ab bhi waqt hai daaman nabi ka thaam le..(2)<br> warna kal mehshar me hogi aisi ruswaayi ke bus</p> 
  <p>5. Ek din mai likhne baitha tha shabe hijrat kaa haal..(2)<br> kya kahu yaaro mujhe bhi aisi neend aayi k bus</p> 
  <p>6. Un farishto ne abhi pucha hi kya tha ai saroj..(2)<br> daf'atan mere sirhaane se sada aayi ke bus</p> 
  <p></p> 
